#: views/pages/legal/privacy.php:92
msgid "We adopt technical and organisational measures appropriate to the risk (Article 32 GDPR), including: hashed passwords, protection against cross-site request forgery, session cookies not accessible to scripts, access control on every board and attachment, re-encoding of uploaded images, and separation between the data of different users. No system is perfectly secure: keep your password private and a copy of important files."
